---
const title = "Null Route Queen";
const tagline = "Networking • Linux • CCNP • Side Quests";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="description" content="Null Route Queen — networking, Linux, CCNP, firewall notes, and side quests." />
		<title>{title}</title>

		<style>
			:root {
				font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
				color: #f4f4f5;
				background: #09090b;
			}

			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			body {
				margin: 0;
				min-height: 100vh;
				background:
					radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12), transparent 35%),
					radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.08), transparent 30%),
					#09090b;
			}

			main {
				width: min(1100px, 92%);
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
			}

			.eyebrow {
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.22em;
				font-size: 0.78rem;
				color: #a1a1aa;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			h1 {
				font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
				line-height: 0.95;
				margin: 0;
				letter-spacing: -0.04em;
			}

			.tagline {
				margin-top: 1.2rem;
				font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
				color: #c4c4cc;
			}

			.intro {
				margin-top: 2rem;
				max-width: 720px;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				line-height: 1.7;
				color: #d4d4d8;
			}

			.grid {
				margin-top: 4rem;
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
				gap: 1rem;
			}

			.card {
				border: 1px solid #27272a;
				background: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.7);
				border-radius: 1rem;
				padding: 1.25rem;
			}

			.card h2 {
				margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
				font-size: 1.05rem;
			}

			.card p {
				margin: 0;
				color: #a1a1aa;
				line-height: 1.5;
			}

			footer {
				margin-top: 5rem;
				padding-top: 1.5rem;
				border-top: 1px solid #27272a;
				color: #71717a;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}
		</style>
	</head>

	<body>
		<main>
			<p class="eyebrow">hello world / null route engaged</p>

			<h1>{title}</h1>

			<p class="tagline">{tagline}</p>

			<p class="intro">
				A personal technical corner for networking, Linux, CCNP study,
				firewall notes, infrastructure war stories, and whatever side quest
				refuses to stay in its lane.
			</p>

			<section class="grid">
				<article class="card">
					<h2>Network Lab</h2>
					<p>WAN topology, routing, packet captures, and things that should have converged by now.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<h2>Firewall Notes</h2>
					<p>Palo Alto, policy design, least privilege, logs, and the occasional mystery vendor IP.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<h2>CCNP Journey</h2>
					<p>STP, MST, routing, labs, and the evolving doctrine that BPDU = toast.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<h2>Linux + Builds</h2>
					<p>Fedora, hardware, homelab ideas, security keys, and projects that get slightly out of hand.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<h2>Side Quests</h2>
					<p>Gaming, weird experiments, and whatever rabbit hole wins today.</p>
				</article>
			</section>

			<footer>
				nullroutequeen.com
			</footer>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>